1
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:05,708
What the hell are
you trying to say, Severin?

2
00:00:05,708 --> 00:00:07,625
That you're behind all of this?

3
00:00:07,625 --> 00:00:09,166
Who else would risk everything

4
00:00:09,166 --> 00:00:11,250
to help you and your family?

5
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:12,250
Stop!

6
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:14,291
Severin, you're insane.

7
00:00:14,291 --> 00:00:19,666
You, a cast-off bastard abandoned by your own family,

8
00:00:20,375 --> 00:00:22,625
expect me to believe you have
connections

9
00:00:22,625 --> 00:00:24,166
in the Sovereign Sanctum?

10
00:00:25,875 --> 00:00:27,041
Livia, I have to-

11
00:00:27,041 --> 00:00:28,250
Stop.

12
00:00:29,166 --> 00:00:32,291
I already know
what's really going on.

13
00:00:32,958 --> 00:00:34,583
It was Redmond.

14
00:00:34,583 --> 00:00:36,375
He used the
Carter name to speak

15
00:00:36,375 --> 00:00:38,291
for me in
front of Steward Jeyn.

16
00:00:38,875 --> 00:00:41,583
That's how my family and I earned this honor.

17
00:00:41,583 --> 00:00:43,208
Redmond introduced you?

18
00:00:43,958 --> 00:00:45,291
Of course it was him.

19
00:00:45,291 --> 00:00:46,958
Who else could it be?

20
00:00:46,958 --> 00:00:49,125
You can be a complete failure, Severin,

21
00:00:49,125 --> 00:00:51,125
but at least be honest.

22
00:00:51,125 --> 00:00:52,583
If the Sovereign Sanctum ever
heard you

23
00:00:52,583 --> 00:00:53,416
say something like that,

24
00:00:53,416 --> 00:00:54,208
they'd erase you.

25
00:00:54,208 --> 00:00:56,208
Just end this engagement already.

26
00:00:56,208 --> 00:00:57,791
You're not worthy of me.

27
00:00:57,791 --> 00:00:59,333
You're so desperate to end this.

28
00:00:59,750 --> 00:01:01,750
Is this about saving your family...

29
00:01:01,750 --> 00:01:06,208
or are you just
eager to marry Redmond?

30
00:01:08,416 --> 00:01:10,041
Don't be ridiculous!

31
00:01:10,041 --> 00:01:12,458
This is all your own failure.

32
00:01:12,458 --> 00:01:15,833
For whatever we had,
just sign the damn papers.

33
00:01:15,833 --> 00:01:18,250
Or you will regret it.

34
00:01:19,916 --> 00:01:21,500
I'll regret it?
